{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 66,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "Make a joyful shout to God, all the earth!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "全地都当向 神欢呼！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "全地都當向上帝歡呼！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "Sing to the glory of his name! glory and praise!",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "歌颂他名的荣耀！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "歌頌他名的榮耀！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Tell God, “How awesome are your deeds! the greatness of your power, your enemies submit themselves to you.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "当对 神说：你的作为何等可畏！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "當對上帝說：你的作為何等可畏！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "All the earth will worship you, and will sing to you; they will sing to your name.” Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "全地要敬拜你，歌颂你，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "全地要敬拜你，歌頌你，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Come, and see God’s deeds— awesome work on behalf of the children of men.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们来看 神所行的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們來看上帝所行的，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "He turned the sea into dry land. They went through the river on foot. There, we rejoiced in him.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他将海变成干地，众民步行过河；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他將海變成乾地，眾民步行過河；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "He rules by his might forever. His eyes watch the nations. the rebellious rise up against him. Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他用权能治理，直到永远。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他用權能治理，直到永遠。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Praise our God, you peoples! Make the sound of his praise heard,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "万民哪，你们当称颂我们的 神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "萬民哪，你們當稱頌我們的上帝，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "who preserves our life among the living, and doesn’t allow our feet to be moved.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他使我们的性命存活，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他使我們的性命存活，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "For you, God, have tested us. You have refined us, as silver is refined.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，你曾试验我们，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，你曾試驗我們，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "11",
      "en": {
        "text": "You brought us into prison. You laid a burden on our backs.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你使我们进入网罗，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你使我們進入網羅，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "12",
      "en": {
        "text": "You allowed men to ride over our heads. went through fire and through water, but you brought us to the place of abundance.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你使人坐车轧我们的头；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你使人坐車軋我們的頭；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "13",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will come into your temple with burnt offerings. I will pay my vows to you,",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要用燔祭进你的殿，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要用燔祭進你的殿，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "14",
      "en": {
        "text": "which my lips promised, and my mouth spoke, when I was in distress.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "就是在急难时我嘴唇所发的、",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "就是在急難時我嘴唇所發的、",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "15",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will offer to you burnt offerings of fat animals, with the offering of rams, I will offer bulls with goats. Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要把肥牛作燔祭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要把肥牛作燔祭，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "16",
      "en": {
        "text": "Come and hear, all you who fear God. I will declare what he has done for my soul.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "凡敬畏 神的人，你们都来听！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "凡敬畏上帝的人，你們都來聽！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "17",
      "en": {
        "text": "I cried to him with my mouth. He was extolled with my tongue.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我曾用口求告他；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我曾用口求告他；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "18",
      "en": {
        "text": "If I cherished sin in my heart, the Lord wouldn’t have listened.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我若心里注重罪孽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我若心裏注重罪孽，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "19",
      "en": {
        "text": "But most certainly, God has listened. heard the voice of my prayer.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但 神实在听见了；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但上帝實在聽見了；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "20",
      "en": {
        "text": "Blessed be God, who has not turned away my prayer, nor his loving kindness from me.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神是应当称颂的！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝是應當稱頌的！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}